#: lesson.yml:title
msgid "Modelling Concentration-driven processes with PLUMED"
msgstr "PLUMED による Concentration-driven Processes のモデル化"

#: lesson.yml:description
msgid ""
"An introduction to the tools that are available in PLUMED for simulating "
"concentration-driven processes such as nucleation, growth and diffusion."
msgstr ""
"Nucleation、Growth、Diffusion などの Concentration-driven Processes "
"をシミュレーションするために PLUMED で利用できるツールの入門。"

